# The octave buttons (+-24 notes per press) move the filter and the bodies: rim 909, clave and clap at
# octaves -2 .. +2, then notes 0 and 127 (outside the keyboard: clamped, never out of range).
tempo 160
steps 64
tail 1.0
track kick
note 0 13 1 110
note 2 37 1 110
note 4 61 1 110
note 8 85 1 110
note 10 109 1 110
note 16 17 1 110
note 18 41 1 110
note 20 65 1 110
note 24 89 1 110
note 26 113 1 110
note 32 5 1 110
note 34 29 1 110
note 36 53 1 110
note 40 77 1 110
note 42 101 1 110
note 48 0 1 110
note 52 127 1 110
expect sound 0 56
expect idle 80
expect peak_below -6
